**67.** In relation to an Administration “a”, Wills Act section 28(4) requires the grant to be disregarded in means consider the case distinctions of g's kind :  when probate has  then FALSE. when letters of administration with the will annexed has  then FALSE. when letters of administration has  then FALSE. when letters of administration pending probate action has  then TRUE. when no grant has  then TRUE.

